architecture-section.content:

**Game State:**
```typescript
interface GameState {
  // Current evening state
  coziness: number;           // 0-100
  timeRemaining: number;      // seconds
  score: number;              // points
  activeEvents: GameEvent[];  // currently active events

  // Game status
  isPlaying: boolean;
  isPaused: boolean;
  gameOver: boolean;
}
```
